            "mp3"
          ],
          "voice": "bddf65d5a84c4a9aa36b7136bdac57a9",
          "style": "young, cheerful and lively, yet calm and gentle"
        },
        "note": "Shiori's voice. Each model has voices of its own, suggested in the model's Voice (Fetch model list brings the ones OpenRouter lists). The voice and style set here are Women KatKat, a voice from Fish Audio's library (friendly, clear, young and bright), and a young, cheerful and lively, yet calm and gentle style: every Fish Audio model starts with them, those described below and any added by id (sent no voice, Fish Audio picks another speaker for each sentence). A model added from the list starts with the first warm voice OpenRouter lists for it. Only Fish Audio, Gemini and OpenAI's gpt-4o-mini-tts take a Style; for the others it is kept, not sent. OpenRouter sends MP3 or PCM only.",
